WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:03.150 --> 00:00:06.690
PROFESSOR: Senior political
officials of the Roman state

00:00:06.690 --> 00:00:12.960
had to take auspices before any
major political event like elections

00:00:12.960 --> 00:00:15.100
and before a battle.

00:00:15.100 --> 00:00:20.040
They would draw on the expertise of
an augur from the College of Augurs.

00:00:20.040 --> 00:00:23.280
Membership of the College
of Augurs was for life,

00:00:23.280 --> 00:00:26.520
with new members elected periodically.

00:00:26.520 --> 00:00:32.250
Two of the main kinds of auspices that
were deliberately taken involved birds.

00:00:32.250 --> 00:00:37.200
One type involved watching for the
flights of specific kinds of birds--

00:00:37.200 --> 00:00:41.820
eagles, vultures,
buzzards, or woodpeckers.

00:00:41.820 --> 00:00:44.160
Or listening for the cries of birds--

00:00:44.160 --> 00:00:47.250
crows, owls, and eagles.

00:00:47.250 --> 00:00:51.120
You had to work out whether
the birds were good or bad,

00:00:51.120 --> 00:00:53.340
and this was determined
partially by where

00:00:53.340 --> 00:00:58.170
they appeared in the sky in relation
to a grid that crisscrossed where

00:00:58.170 --> 00:01:01.820
the viewer stood, the
height at which they flew,

00:01:01.820 --> 00:01:06.030
and the speed and noise
of their wing movements.

00:01:06.030 --> 00:01:09.510
The other main method of
bird divination involved

00:01:09.510 --> 00:01:12.330
observing whether or not
the sacred chickens ate

00:01:12.330 --> 00:01:15.570
the food that was given to them.

00:01:15.570 --> 00:01:19.020
You had to take auspices at
night, and they were valid

00:01:19.020 --> 00:01:21.450
only for the day to come.

00:01:21.450 --> 00:01:27.720
So if the activity you are taking
auspices for was continued or delayed,

00:01:27.720 --> 00:01:30.330
you had to repeat them.

00:01:30.330 --> 00:01:35.640
Even though you are only looking for a
yes or no on the timing of the event,

00:01:35.640 --> 00:01:41.490
the law was complicated and open to
interpretation and to challenges.

00:01:41.490 --> 00:01:46.620
Even if the day had been cleared for
the activity, other offices of state

00:01:46.620 --> 00:01:50.610
could claim to see spontaneous
signs from the gods that meant

00:01:50.610 --> 00:01:53.330
that the event had to be canceled.

